While working on the Egypt: Old Kingdom, we are still paying attention to the previous projects. Here are some improvements for The Bronze Age - HD Edition:
-       French and Polish languages are added;
-	Fixed a bug of building a megalith before the researching of religion;
-	Minor language mistakes are fixed in English and Chinese versions.
